WEBVTT

00:00:00.118 --> 00:00:05.494
This video shows how to add a staff member on your phone, using the full form.

00:00:07.171 --> 00:00:16.267
Tap the menu button at the top left, open HR & Staff, and choose Staff Directory. It lists everyone who works at the school.

00:00:19.120 --> 00:00:25.000
Tap Full Form at the top of the page. The complete staff form opens.

00:00:26.002 --> 00:00:37.210
Enter the first name, Zainab, and the last name, Hussain. Then enter the email and the phone number. The first and last name are the only required fields.

00:00:44.857 --> 00:00:56.089
Scroll to Employment Details and choose the department, here Academic, and the designation, here Teacher. Both are optional, but they make reports and payroll easier.

00:00:56.769 --> 00:01:08.433
Tap Add Staff Member at the bottom of the form. A login account is optional and can be added later. You return to the directory, where the new staff member now appears.

00:01:22.193 --> 00:01:26.825
The staff member is saved and ready to use in payroll and reports.
